Z||000000||Formula88||09-21-2001||10:09 AM||||Yup - found some.  There's a man who found a supplier who still had some and he bought all he could.  He's setup a Kiosk at the corner of Maynard and Chatam St. in Cary, in the Grocery Boy Jr. parking lot.  He's got the hand held flags, about a 2' long wooden handle and the flag is about 1' wide.  His price is $5 which is very fair.  When I went by last night, he said he was out for then, but should have more by this weekend.  He will also be selling them at:<P>N.C. Flea Market, NC State Fairgrounds<BR>Indoor Flea Market Mall, Capital Blvd., Raleigh (Next to Chevy Dealership)<P>Just thought I'd pass this along.<BR>||||reg||4
